</a>

<main class="container">
        
        <section class="fig-image-wrapper">
            <img src="/Source/Animals2/otter/otter.jpg" alt="Asian Short-clawed Otter Expedition">
            
            <div class="hero-text-overlay">
                <div class="header-title">The Dexterous Swimmers</div>
                <h2 class="header-subtitle">Asian short-clawed otter (Aonyx cinereus)</h2>
                <div class="iucn-badge-inline">
                    <span class="iucn-tag">IUCN Status:</span>
                    <span class="iucn-status-value">Vulnerable</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-split">
            
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div id="carouselTrack">
                    
                    <!-- Slide 1: About -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide active">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            As the <span style="color: var(--iucn-vulnerable); font-weight: 700;">smallest of all otter species</span>, these highly social mammals are famous for their <span style="color: var(--iucn-vulnerable); font-weight: 700;">partly webbed, dexterous paws</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">These otters possess thick, insulating fur that they keep impeccably clean through constant grooming. Their namesake short, sensitive claws and partly webbed feet give them remarkable dexterity for grabbing prey, while their long tails provide powerful propulsion in the water and vital balance when standing upright on land.</p>
                            <p>Despite standing only about 2 feet tall—with half of that height being their tail—they have voracious appetites, consuming up to a quarter of their body weight every single day! They are also deeply loyal, forming monogamous pairs for life and travelling in fiercely defensive extended family groups to protect their pups.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 2: Threats -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            A charismatic wetland resident losing its home to human expansion. Their wild populations face severe survival pressures from <span style="color: var(--iucn-vulnerable); font-weight: 700;">habitat loss and illegal hunting</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">The freshwater swamps, rivers, and mangrove coastal regions they naturally inhabit are being rapidly taken over and degraded by expanding human development. As their vital wetland environments shrink, their numbers are steadily declining across Asia.</p>
                            <p>Compounding the devastating loss of their habitat, these otters are also ruthlessly hunted down for their pelts and internal organs, which are illegally traded for use in traditional medicines, pushing this vulnerable species further toward the brink.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic" style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            Support & Experience the Wildlife Firsthand
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; text-align: left;">
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/otter/otter-ticket.jpg" alt="Otter Ticket">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Visit your favourite animals</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">Book your visit today and see all the amazing animals at the zoo!</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Book Now</a>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/otter/otter-membership.jpg" alt="Otter Member">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Become a member and don't miss a thing</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">See these magnificent animals any day you like with free unlimited entry for a year, plus up to 10% off future experiences.</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Become a Member</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous Slide">←</button>
                    <span class="slide-indicator" id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
                    <button id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next Slide">→</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-grid">
                
                <!-- Species Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="15.5" rx="4.5" ry="3.5"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="9.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="10" cy="7.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="14" cy="7.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="9.5" r="1.5"/></svg>
                        Species
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Mammal </div>
                     <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Smallest otter species</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Life Span Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 2h14M5 22h14M7 2l5 8 5-8M7 22l5-8 5 8"/></svg>
                        Life Span
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">11 to 16 years</div>
                     <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Up to 20 under human care</span>
                    
                </div>
                
                <!-- Habitat Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12,2 3,17 21,17"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
                        Habitat
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Freshwater swamps & rivers</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Region Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        Region
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">India to SE</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Diet Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 2v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3 3 3 0 0 0 3-3V2"/><line x1="6" y1="11" x2="6" y2="22"/><line x1="3" y1="2" x2="3" y2="6"/><line x1="9" y1="2" x2="9" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="21" y1="2" x2="21" y2="22"/><path d="M17 2v8a4 4 0 0 0 4 4"/></svg>
                        Diet
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Carnivore </div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Crabs, snails & small fish</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Avg Weight Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="8" width="22" height="8" rx="1"/><line x1="5" y1="8" x2="5" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="9" y2="14"/><line x1="13" y1="8" x2="13" y2="12"/><line x1="17" y1="8" x2="17" y2="14"/></svg>
                        Avg Weight
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">2 to 5kg</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Behaviour & Zoo Location Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        Behaviour & Zoo Location
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3;">
                        Social & loyal <br>
                        <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block;">Located at the Realm of the Red Ape exit</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <section class="doc-band">
        <div class="dashed-border-top"></div>
        <div class="doc-container">
            <div class="doc-text">
                <h3> Paws of the River </h3>
                <p> Dive into the intricate social bonds and survival strategies of Asia's most dexterous and smallest otter species. </p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/pEynSy_Yyw0?si=EP_hCCxvb9CNlvCu" target="_blank" class="doc-btn">
                <span class="play-icon">▶</span> Watch Film
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-border-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const totalSlides = slides.length;
            const indicator = document.getElementById('slideIndicator');
            let currentSlide = 0;

            function updateSlide(index) {
                slides.forEach(slide => slide.classList.remove('active'));
                slides[index].classList.add('active');
                indicator.textContent = `0${index + 1} / 0${totalSlides}`;
            }

            document.getElementById('nextBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            document.getElementById('prevBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + totalSlides) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            updateSlide(currentSlide);
        });
    </script>


